  "description": "NLB \u2192 ingress \u2192 DC \u2192 Kubernetes Service \u2192 pod. HAProxy excludes on its active health checks; slow arbitrary business responses do not automatically exclude an otherwise healthy pod. Missing telemetry is not an UP state. NLB/Grafana and auth health are independent. Grafana home is backup.",
